Urgency: medium
Maintainer: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Changed-By: Arnaud Kientz <arnaud@linuxmuster.net>
Description:
 linuxmuster-cli7 - Tools and CLI for the linuxmuster.net 7 server.
Changes:
 linuxmuster-cli7 (7.4.5) lmn74; urgency=medium
 .
   * [lmngroup] Add new typer: ls, create, delete, legacy (list
     sophomorix-groups not yet migrated to OU=LMNGroups) and migrate.
   * [tests] Add a complete test suite for the up, user, userlog and users
     typers (previously untested).
   * Lazy-import Samba/smbclient bindings in the check_smbclient and samba
     typers to optimize load time.
   * Add a README for each typer.
   * [quotas] Show a clear message instead of crashing with an
     UnboundLocalError when ls() is called without --class or --teachers.
   * [mgmtgroup] Fix manage() silently doing nothing when neither
     --add-members nor --remove-members is given (the guard checked for
     None, but both options default to an empty string).
   * [printers] Show a printer as "Not registered" instead of silently
     dropping it from the table when it has no matching ldap entry.
   * [samba] Show a clear message instead of crashing with a KeyError when
     drives() is called with an unknown --school.
   * [linbo, schoolclass] Fix --school being accepted but never forwarded
     to the underlying call in lastsync() and sync().
   * [student] Fix manage() aborting the rest of an --add-parents/
     --remove-parents list on the first failure; each parent is now handled
     independently and failures no longer hide prior successes.
